      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">- High-End Kitchen Appliances: Electrolux - Founded in Sweden in 1919<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">including a gas cooktop, oven, dishwasher, and rangehood,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">catering to both family needs and culinary enthusiasts. The<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">beige stone benchtops and splash backs provide an elegant and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">durable finish.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">- Stylish Bathrooms: Bathrooms are fitted with Belga grey tiles and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">high-quality fixtures, offering a luxurious and functional space.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">- Modern Interiors: Living areas feature engineered timber flooring,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">while bedrooms are carpeted with grey wool, creating a cozy and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">inviting atmosphere. Laminated cabinetry throughout the homes<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">ensures stylish and practical storage solutions.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">- Energy-Efficient Comfort: Each home is fitted with LED downlights<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">and a split-system air conditioning unit, providing energy-efficient<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">lighting and year-round climate control.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1726 characters\">- Very Detail Counts: Every detail, from undermounted sinks and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
